{"unit_id":"Sttrevens__dsh-cost-meter#feature-1","repo":"Sttrevens/dsh-cost-meter","commit":"9f8a924f2496856f671a508aca44bff7d3377770","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@steven-wu/dsh-cost-meter 的功能「会话成本徽标」：在 Web 会话标题工具区显示累计美元费用。使用投影中的令牌用量和定价表计算，并可悬停查看分项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:69-78","lib/index.js:212-220"]}
