{"unit_id":"Sttrevens__dsh-cost-meter#feature-3","repo":"Sttrevens/dsh-cost-meter","commit":"9f8a924f2496856f671a508aca44bff7d3377770","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@steven-wu/dsh-cost-meter 的功能「自定义定价」：按 provider/model 为每百万令牌设置不同价格。首次启动生成默认 JSON 表，也可提供自定义定价文件并重启 Web 配置应用修改。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:27-42","lib/index.js:59-75"]}
{"unit_id":"Sttrevens__dsh-cost-meter#feature-4","repo":"Sttrevens/dsh-cost-meter","commit":"9f8a924f2496856f671a508aca44bff7d3377770","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@steven-wu/dsh-cost-meter 的功能「用量事件折算」：监听会话中的 assistant usage 和 provider/model 信息，将输入、输出及缓存读写令牌折算成费用，并更新整段会话与各轮汇总。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:156-220"]}
{"unit_id":"Sttrevens__dsh-cost-meter#caveat-1","repo":"Sttrevens/dsh-cost-meter","commit":"9f8a924f2496856f671a508aca44bff7d3377770","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@steven-wu/dsh-cost-meter 使用本地 JSON 定价文件，首次运行会尝试创建默认文件；可用 DSH_COST_PRICING 指定路径，修改价格后需重启 Web 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:40-42","lib/index.js:59-75"]}
